  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Legacy Era Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><b>Base Item:</b>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bowcaster\" title=\"Bowcaster\">Bowcaster</a> </p><p><b>Heirloom Bonus:</b>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Legendary_Icon\" title=\"Legendary Icon\">Legendary Icon</a> </p><p>The favored Weapon of the loyal and dedicated hero Chewbacca, this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bowcaster\" title=\"Bowcaster\">Bowcaster</a> represents decades of battle prowess in the hands of one of the greatest <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wookiee\" title=\"Wookiee\">Wookiees</a> of all time. </p><p>Perhaps the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bowcaster\" title=\"Bowcaster\">Bowcaster</a> is handed down after Chewbacca's death to his descendants, a hero worthy enough to carry on Chewbacca's legacy. </p><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Legendary_Icon\" title=\"Legendary Icon\">Legendary Icon</a>:</b> When carrying this item in plain sight, you gain favorable circumstances on all&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a>-based&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skill_Checks\" title=\"Skill Checks\">Skill Checks</a>&nbsp;(except&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_the_Force\" title=\"Use the Force\">Use the Force</a> checks). </p><p><b>Accurate:&nbsp;</b>This weapon takes no penalty when firing at targets at Short&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p>",
